  "FTF-scope": "user 11-05 20:5x step 1: the FT-cap train / valid caps are removed; every structure that passes the finetune.Pool filters (level label, finite, even electron count, fmax <= 10 eV/A, exact-duplicate dedupe FT-dedupe, D0 holdout FT-d0hold, truncated Nurion systems FT-leak-trunc) is used. The pilot / capped models are not retrained; their split files and models are not touched.",
